      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. i see you included most of the features. i'm a bit worried though, the marketing lead just saw the draft and said it feels a little bit like a list or a manual rather than a personal email. \n\ncan you try making it feel more \"human\" and empathetic like we talked about? but keep the score high—the tool is literally telling us the \"value\" is based on that feature count/score, so please don't drop the list or anything, just try to weave them in more naturally so it doesn't look like a wall of text. i really need that score to stay at the top so they don't reject the campaign.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
